<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">unarmed-combat</ansi> skill

The <ansi fg="skill">unarmed-combat</ansi> skill governs fighting without
weapons — fists, kicks, grapples, and special unarmed moves.
Higher ranks improve your hit chance, unarmed damage, and the
power of kick, trip, and grapple maneuvers.

Unarmed-combat improves through use. Fighting without a weapon
and using special moves like <ansi fg="command">kick</ansi>,
<ansi fg="command">trip</ansi>, and <ansi fg="command">grapple</ansi>
all advance this skill.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help kick</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help trip</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help grapple</ansi>
